{"id":"n15849-1-7","stage":2,"title":"슬쩍 · (趁别人不注意)迅速地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15849-1-7-1","ko":"어? 여기에 있던 내 지갑이 어디 갔지?","zh":"咦？我放在这里的钱包去哪儿了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어?","meaning":"咦","explanation":"어：咦","readings":[{"term":"어","audio":"/audio/228794e2524374dc8637.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26153","senseId":"1","lemma":"어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여기에","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있던","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지갑이","meaning":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","explanation":"지갑：钱包，钱夹，钱袋；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지갑","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31502","senseId":"1","lemma":"지갑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갔지?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"17","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"228794e2524374dc","term":"어","zh":"咦","audio":"/audio/228794e2524374dc8637.mp3","entryId":"26153","definition":"感到惊讶、慌张、焦急、急促时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["어"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"523a0f1558bc4c4d","term":"지갑","zh":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3","entryId":"31502","definition":"为便于携带钱、卡、名片等物品，用皮或布料制作的小包。","pronunciation":["지갑"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"消失不见。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f14256b5067745304d12.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15849-1-7-2","ko":"누가 슬쩍 훔쳐 갔나 봐.","zh":"看来是有人偷偷偷走了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁，某某，有人","explanation":"누구：谁，某某，有人；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"3","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"슬쩍","meaning":"(趁别人不注意)迅速地","explanation":"슬쩍：(趁别人不注意)迅速地","readings":[{"term":"슬쩍","audio":"/audio/9636ce4be65cfcd6aa17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15849","senseId":"1","lemma":"슬쩍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"훔쳐","meaning":"偷，盗，盗取","explanation":"훔치다：偷，盗，盗取；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"훔치다","audio":"/audio/e7f0ceb36466c81e3510.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87746","senseId":"1","lemma":"훔치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갔나","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"17","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁，某某，有人","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指无须透露姓名的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"9636ce4be65cfcd6","term":"슬쩍","zh":"(趁别人不注意)迅速地","audio":"/audio/9636ce4be65cfcd6aa17.mp3","entryId":"15849","definition":"不让别人看到，快速地。","pronunciation":["슬쩍"]},{"id":"e7f0ceb36466c81e","term":"훔치다","zh":"偷，盗，盗取","audio":"/audio/e7f0ceb36466c81e3510.mp3","entryId":"87746","definition":"统统拿走别人的东西，当做自己的。","pronunciation":["훔치다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"消失不见。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/92af7547b7c62b292b50.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.675,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15849","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":87,"sequenceScore":2.4003,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看来是有人偷偷偷走了。","等了这么久，公交车怎么还不来啊？","咦？我放在这里的钱包去哪儿了？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["看来是有人偷偷偷走了。","咦？我放在这里的钱包去哪儿了？","等了这么久，公交车怎么还不来啊？"],"answer":0}]}
